      <h1 id="oadp-enabling-parallel-backup-processing_{context}" class="group scroll-mt-20">Enabling parallel backup processing<a href="#oadp-enabling-parallel-backup-processing_{context}" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">By default, OpenShift API for Data Protection processes only one backup in the <code>InProgress</code> phase at a time. Configure the <code>DataProtectionApplication</code> (DPA) custom resource (CR) to run several backups simultaneously to prevent smaller backups from being queued behind larger operations.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>You must be logged in as a user with <code>cluster-admin</code> privileges.</li>
      <li>You must have a DPA CR configured and deployed in your cluster.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Edit your DPA CR:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc edit dpa <dpa_name> -n openshift-adp"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Add the <code>concurrentBackups</code> field in the <code>spec.configuration.velero</code> section of your DPA CR:
      <CodeBlock code={"  configuration:\n    velero:\n      concurrentBackups: <integer_limit>\n      defaultPlugins:\n        - openshift\n        - aws\n        - csi"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>Replace <code>&lt;integer_limit&gt;</code> with the maximum number of backups you want OADP to process simultaneously. The default value is <code>1</code>. Backups that target overlapping namespaces are automatically serialized.</p>
      </li>
      </ol>
      <p><strong>Verification</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Verify that all backups are in the <code>InProgress</code> phase simultaneously:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get backups.velero.io -n openshift-adp"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                STATUS       CREATED                        EXPIRES\nbackup-namespace1   InProgress   2026-04-28 10:00:00 +0000 UTC  29d\nbackup-namespace2   InProgress   2026-04-28 10:00:05 +0000 UTC  29d"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      </ul>
